# Communication language

- **Chat with the user**: write in **Russian** (unless the user explicitly switches).
- **Project artifacts**: `specs/**`, constitution, `ods-help/**`, code comments, commits, PR text that lands in the repo — **English** (technical IT). Portal UI strings: i18n `en`/`ru` only.
- Do not rewrite already-English project text into Russian. Translate Russian → English only when writing project artifacts.
